{"name":"Rosette","hex":"#ce8e8b","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Rosette","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A female given name from French."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Rosette"}],"entries":[{"title":"Trophy","blocks":[{"text":"A trophy is a tangible, decorative item used to remind one of a specific achievement, serving as recognition or evidence of merit. Trophies are most commonly awarded for sporting events, ranging from youth sports to professional level athletics. Additionally, trophies are presented for achievements in Academic, Arts and Entertainment, Business, Military, Professional awards, Community Service, Hunting, and Environmental accomplishments. In many contexts, especially in sports, medals are often given out either as the trophy or along with more traditional trophies."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Benin%2C_Championnats_nationaux_de_scrabble_2019%2C_troph%C3%A9es.jpg/330px-Benin%2C_Championnats_nationaux_de_scrabble_2019%2C_troph%C3%A9es.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trophy","wikidata":"Q381165"},{"title":"Rosette (design)","blocks":[{"text":"A rosette is a round, stylized flower design."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ec/Orna115-Rosetten.png/330px-Orna115-Rosetten.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rosette_(design)","wikidata":"Q1277215"},{"title":"Rosette (zoology)","blocks":[{"text":"A rosette is a marking or formation shaped like a flower or blossom of a rose, found on the fur and skin of some animals, particularly cats."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Jaguar_animal_panthera_onca.jpg/330px-Jaguar_animal_panthera_onca.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.or